      "message": "Thanks Chris, \n\nApologies for the delay in reply. We don\u0027t need cumulative_runnable_avg in cfs_rq structure when CFS_BANDWIDTH (depends on FAIR_GROUP_SCHED) is not enabled. So adding cra unconditionally in cfs_rq is not right. The cfs_rq-\u003ecumulative_runnable_avg should be guarded with CFS_BANDWITH.\n\nThis is the reason why I had to move under CFS_BANDWIDTH.\n\nBr,\nSatya",
